{"title":"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Isaac has written down one integer two times and another integer three times. The sum of the five numbers is 100, and one of the numbers is 28. What is the other number?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/9/ed9c720968d12ff40a1fd0e7b06e6f014266c2cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\; 8 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\; 11 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\; 14 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\; 15 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\; 18$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"382\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the number written two times, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> the number written three times. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f208ebdf5cab4425ed70b185f589a82a00124136.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 3b = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />. Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/1/461460b266515cdc0e7f3835ff89f217ae67e01b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 28$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> doesn't yield an integer for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, so it must be that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92bc82af4f12400acfc51fb7b06b073188d52830.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 28$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, and we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/d/96dda19c835297779aec55f8e9688008065d033f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a + 84 = 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"110\" height=\"14\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, we obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/a/f6a548589bc6290932bdd052a4ca9742f1b626c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}\\; 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"89\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B\">2015 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2015_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2015 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\